======== A. WITHOUT rate limiting
--- no rate limit: 30 concurrent requests
         30 200
    admitted=30  p95_latency_of_admitted=0.168s

======== B. WITH rate limiting (average=5, burst=10)
{"average":5,"burst":10}
--- rate limited: 30 concurrent requests
         19 429
         11 200
    admitted=11  p95_latency_of_admitted=0.075s

======== Interpretation
429 responses are the admission control working: excess load is refused at the edge
instead of being queued through the gateway into checkout, pricing and the database.
